OL,3,GNEWSA'Five years of Long Covid and my
OL,4,Asymptoms are worse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs 18-year-old Molly Foden walks along
OL,7,Fthe beach near her home she tells me
OL,8,Fwhat it has been like living with Long
OL,9,FCovid for five years.
OL,11,F"I get a lot of dizziness, I'm very
OL,12,Ffatigued, and I have a lot of body
OL,13,Fweakness and pain," she says.
OL,15,FThere are no official figures for the
OL,16,Fnumber living with the condition but
OL,17,Fthe charity Long Covid Kids estimate it
OL,18,Faffects thousands of children and says
OL,19,Fit has supported 11,000 families during
OL,20,Fthe past six years.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
