OL,3,GNEWSA'Five years of Long Covid and my
OL,4,Asymptoms are worse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMolly says she has learnt to live with
OL,7,Fthe symptoms. It is a year since I last
OL,8,Fmet her in Weymouth, Dorset, and in
OL,9,Fthat time she tells me the condition
OL,10,Fhas worsened.
